  "thag1.2:1.1": "2 upasanto uparato ",
  "thag1.2:1.2": "mantabhāṇī anuddhato ",
  "thag1.2:1.3": "dhunāti pāpake dhamme ",
  "thag1.2:1.4": "dumapattaṃva mālutoti. ",
  "thag1.2:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mahākoṭṭhito thero gāthaṃ abhāsittha. "
